From d415e7cdd38aa3778d01c19084831ebdf0e7a328 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Invinciblx777 <invinciblx777@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 20:27:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] chore(filesystem): update minimatch to 11.0.3

minimatch below 11.0.1 is affected by GHSA-g3hv-75wg-m249. The server
declares minimatch ^10.0.1, so no 2.x release can resolve a fixed
version. It calls only minimatch(path, pattern, { dot: true }), which
minimatch 11 keeps. The lockfile adds @isaacs/nonrecursive-glob-match
1.0.3 (BlueOak-1.0.0), a new dependency of minimatch 11.

npm run validate -w src/filesystem: 25 test files passed, 655 tests
passed, 14 skipped, before and after. npm run coverage -w
src/filesystem passed. npm audit -w src/filesystem: 0 vulnerabilities.
---
 .changeset/filesystem-minimatch-11.md |  5 +++++
 package-lock.json                     | 25 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/filesystem/package.json           |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 .changeset/filesystem-minimatch-11.md

diff --git a/.changeset/filesystem-minimatch-11.md b/.changeset/filesystem-minimatch-11.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..df0f3d6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/filesystem-minimatch-11.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem": patch
+---
+
+Update `minimatch` to `^11.0.3`, outside the range of GHSA-g3hv-75wg-m249 (minimatch below 11.0.1). `search_files` and the `excludePatterns` of `search_files` and `directory_tree` match exactly as before.
